Subject: [PATCH 19/29] debian: version for the Galaxy S10+ port

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 debian/changelog | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 32 insertions(+)

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index 08778f7c..daa5ad4f 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,35 @@
+plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus13) rolling; urgency=medium
+
+  * Battery percentage sized by its laid-out text (implicitWidth was for a
+    smaller font), so it stays clear of the front camera.
+
+ -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:01:05 +0000
+
+plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus12) rolling; urgency=medium
+
+  * Battery indicator: Repeater instead of a ListView, which reported too
+    little width; the percentage stays clear of the front camera.
+
+ -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 06:22:48 +0000
+
+plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus11) rolling; urgency=medium
+
+  * Battery entry takes the width its layout computes (the hand-made sum
+    used an unknown root.elementSpacing), percentage clear of the camera.
+
+ -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 05:43:51 +0000
+
+plasma-mobile-wf (6.5.2-1~git20251121171019.91ba13c.next.plasma.6.5+s10plus10) rolling; urgency=medium
+
+  * Battery indicator reports its real width, so the percentage stays
+    clear of the front camera.
+  * Action drawer window stays mapped: creating it on each pull delayed
+    the first frame by ~220 ms; no blur window (wayfire has no blur).
+  * Drawer release follows the motion of the last 80 ms, not the last
+    touch event, so a quick flick no longer snaps back.
+
+ -- Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 04:49:41 +0000
+
